<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY - WEATHER: RAINS, SOME STORMS - JULY 25.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY - WEATHER: RAINS, SOME STORMS - JULY 25.</headline>
<text>
<p>Clouds, rain and possibly storms forecast. Highs of 20 to 30 C. Clouds will slowly disappear from Sunday and summer will return.</p>
